## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005
## Title: Elite Target Frame
## Notes: Applies Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) skins to the target unit frame with horizontal mirroring and adjustable X offset.
## Notes-deDE: Wendet Elite Player Frame (Enhanced)-Skins auf das Zielrahmen mit horizontaler Spiegelung und einstellbarem X-Versatz an.
## Notes-esES: Aplica skins de Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) al marco del objetivo con volteo horizontal y ajuste de posición X.
## Notes-esMX: Aplica skins de Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) al marco del objetivo con volteo horizontal y ajuste de posición X.
## Notes-frFR: Applique les skins Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) au cadre de la cible avec miroir horizontal et décalage X réglable.
## Notes-itIT: Applica skin Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) al riquadro bersaglio con specchio orizzontale e offset X regolabile.
## Notes-koKR: Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) 스킨을 대상 유닛 프레임에 적용하며, 수평 반전 및 X 오프셋 조정을 지원합니다.
## Notes-ptBR: Aplica skins do Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) ao quadro do alvo com espelhamento horizontal e deslocamento X ajustável.
## Notes-ruRU: Применяет скины Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) к рамке цели с горизонтальным отражением и настраиваемым смещением по X.
## Notes-zhCN: 将 Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) 皮肤应用到目标框体，支持水平翻转与 X 偏移调整。
## Notes-zhTW: 將 Elite Player Frame (Enhanced) 皮膚套用到目標框架，支援水平翻轉與 X 偏移調整。
